{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3832239122722703356,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux Capabilities",
      "source_hash": 10562909846539406958,
      "context_hash": 9180366374543142780,
      "translation": "Linux Capabilities",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975627Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Fine-grained privilege decomposition",
      "source_hash": 96706918335192226,
      "context_hash": 18380454903437315847,
      "translation": "세분화된 권한 분해",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975627Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem with root",
      "source_hash": 4585363139230534190,
      "context_hash": 4448003607592994158,
      "translation": "root의 문제점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975627Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Traditionally, privilege in Unix is binary: a process either has UID 0 (root, omnipotent) or it doesn't.",
      "source_hash": 1775572621822956794,
      "context_hash": 10902547778288893175,
      "translation": "전통적으로 Unix에서 권한은 이분법적입니다. 프로세스는 UID 0(root, 전능함)을 가지거나 가지지 않거나 둘 중 하나입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UID": "UID",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is too coarse — a web server needs to bind to port 80, but shouldn't have access to raw network sockets, loading kernel modules, or rebooting the system.",
      "source_hash": 2754610766272427714,
      "context_hash": 14380057798612417739,
      "translation": "이는 너무 거칩니다. 웹 서버는 포트 80에 바인드해야 하지만, raw 네트워크 소켓, 커널 모듈 로드, 시스템 재부팅에는 접근할 수 없어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Kernel Modules": "커널 모듈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux capabilities split root's power into ~40 discrete privileges that can be granted independently.",
      "source_hash": 13177512375491315264,
      "context_hash": 15878259967247029347,
      "translation": "Linux capability는 root의 권한을 독립적으로 부여할 수 있는 약 40개의 개별 권한으로 나눕니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Based on the withdrawn POSIX.1e draft standard; introduced in Linux 2.2 (January 1999).",
      "source_hash": 5770741802256783490,
      "context_hash": 2691367065403285023,
      "translation": "철회된 POSIX.1e 초안 표준에 기반하며, Linux 2.2(1999년 1월)에서 도입되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "File capability support (allowing binaries to have capabilities without setuid) was added in Linux 2.6.24 by Serge Hallyn — [`b53767719b6c`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b53767719b6cd8789392ea3e7e2eb7b8906898f0).",
      "source_hash": 10946577446611467841,
      "context_hash": 15337809716536148784,
      "translation": "파일 capability 지원(setuid 없이 바이너리가 capability를 가질 수 있게 함)은 Serge Hallyn이 Linux 2.6.24에서 추가했습니다 — [`b53767719b6c`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/b53767719b6cd8789392ea3e7e2eb7b8906898f0).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:3",
      "source": "See [`man 7 capabilities`](https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/capabilities.7.html).",
      "source_hash": 10613786444450617141,
      "context_hash": 10329628125480180982,
      "translation": "[`man 7 capabilities`](https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/capabilities.7.html)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The 40 capabilities",
      "source_hash": 2389543849204280782,
      "context_hash": 10599687161346426987,
      "translation": "40개의 capability",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Capability sets",
      "source_hash": 4105065089167678392,
      "context_hash": 1162147569212128122,
      "translation": "capability 집합",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each process has **5 capability sets**:",
      "source_hash": 7038349340247565840,
      "context_hash": 18249498776548009046,
      "translation": "각 프로세스는 **5개의 capability 집합**을 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Rules:",
      "source_hash": 4261705109244163827,
      "context_hash": 12707015602397081957,
      "translation": "규칙:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**Effective**: used in access checks (`capable()`)",
      "source_hash": 4592499423815346333,
      "context_hash": 17495673414494606549,
      "translation": "**Effective**: 접근 검사(`capable()`)에 사용됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Permitted**: superset of effective; can re-add dropped effective caps",
      "source_hash": 6547721667292831356,
      "context_hash": 2237668214432989503,
      "translation": "**Permitted**: effective의 상위 집합이며, 제거된 effective capability를 다시 추가할 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "**Inheritable**: can be passed across exec if the file also has it",
      "source_hash": 16213813281617990746,
      "context_hash": 8484788144098631875,
      "translation": "**Inheritable**: 파일에도 해당 capability가 있으면 exec를 거쳐 전달될 수 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**Bounding**: ceiling — caps in bset can be in permitted; once dropped, cannot be regained",
      "source_hash": 2934741426937961765,
      "context_hash": 10545179743634836257,
      "translation": "**Bounding**: 상한선입니다. bset에 있는 capability만 permitted에 있을 수 있으며, 한 번 제거되면 다시 얻을 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975628Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "**Ambient**: automatically inherited by children and across exec (since Linux 4.3 — [`58319057b784`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/58319057b7849f6272afebf1ffeed1da70e5f68a) by Andy Lutomirski)",
      "source_hash": 6634636552115539464,
      "context_hash": 10580627675426082290,
      "translation": "**Ambient**: 자식 프로세스와 exec를 거쳐 자동으로 상속됩니다(Linux 4.3부터 — Andy Lutomirski의 [`58319057b784`](https://git.kernel.org/linus/58319057b7849f6272afebf1ffeed1da70e5f68a))",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Checking capabilities in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 4350525396378070668,
      "context_hash": 2418754661883531840,
      "translation": "커널에서 capability 검사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`capable()` checks `current->cred->cap_effective`.",
      "source_hash": 8862718660420758630,
      "context_hash": 15283898739719365647,
      "translation": "`capable()`은 `current->cred->cap_effective`를 검사합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Viewing and modifying capabilities",
      "source_hash": 11741404170175243161,
      "context_hash": 12479475407810572883,
      "translation": "capability 조회 및 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "File capabilities (setcap)",
      "source_hash": 3547960293213086041,
      "context_hash": 10504934306460229365,
      "translation": "파일 capability(setcap)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Executables can have capabilities in their extended attributes, allowing them to run with elevated privileges without setuid:",
      "source_hash": 13581839279208134861,
      "context_hash": 115814215764358490,
      "translation": "실행 파일은 확장 속성(extended attribute)에 capability를 가질 수 있으며, 이를 통해 setuid 없이 상승된 권한으로 실행될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `e`, `i`, `p` flags:",
      "source_hash": 11336603538273912370,
      "context_hash": 4926451546445179619,
      "translation": "`e`, `i`, `p` 플래그:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`e` = effective",
      "source_hash": 2844384667551595352,
      "context_hash": 800749457206687643,
      "translation": "`e` = effective",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`i` = inheritable",
      "source_hash": 7377369246808843896,
      "context_hash": 1829832986098351424,
      "translation": "`i` = inheritable",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`p` = permitted",
      "source_hash": 1879311903591652190,
      "context_hash": 2022125623259615503,
      "translation": "`p` = permitted",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Capability-based privilege dropping",
      "source_hash": 7589825466707171517,
      "context_hash": 2298388553579767471,
      "translation": "capability 기반 권한 내려놓기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A properly written daemon starts with root, acquires needed capabilities, then drops the rest:",
      "source_hash": 651601822401956041,
      "context_hash": 3014437565725506452,
      "translation": "올바르게 작성된 데몬은 root로 시작하여 필요한 capability를 획득한 다음 나머지를 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "daemon": "데몬"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "No-New-Privileges",
      "source_hash": 5514548615053226045,
      "context_hash": 3468624531738846840,
      "translation": "No-New-Privileges",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS` prevents a process from gaining any new privileges through exec (even via setuid binaries or file capabilities):",
      "source_hash": 8783129467606160553,
      "context_hash": 8460766988627044238,
      "translation": "`PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS`는 프로세스가 exec를 통해(setuid 바이너리나 파일 capability를 통해서도) 새로운 권한을 얻지 못하도록 막습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975629Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "CAP_SYS_ADMIN: the problem capability",
      "source_hash": 16809700663241786021,
      "context_hash": 13889578786517376282,
      "translation": "CAP_SYS_ADMIN: 문제의 capability",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:56:04.975630Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`CAP_SYS_ADMIN` is sometimes called \"the new root\" because it covers too many unrelated operations:",
      "source_hash": 9331991812948482038,
      "context_hash": 6100711272684182468,
      "translation": "`CAP_SYS_ADMIN`은 서로 관련 없는 너무 많은 작업을 포괄하기 때문에 \"새로운 root\"라고 불리기도 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015296Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Mount/unmount filesystems",
      "source_hash": 3790812224511695942,
      "context_hash": 2832762626564617239,
      "translation": "파일시스템 마운트/언마운트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015298Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Configure network namespaces",
      "source_hash": 9467847606066683032,
      "context_hash": 15637494619645592485,
      "translation": "네트워크 네임스페이스 구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespaces": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015299Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`ptrace` (with restrictions)",
      "source_hash": 4822821823371761309,
      "context_hash": 8457054349088260796,
      "translation": "`ptrace`(제한 있음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015301Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Access kernel keyring",
      "source_hash": 4112130696046182044,
      "context_hash": 10960938186038505424,
      "translation": "커널 키링 접근",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "keyring": "키링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:33:37.535832Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Modify disk quotas",
      "source_hash": 13548663118844006569,
      "context_hash": 15269567899126338894,
      "translation": "디스크 쿼터 수정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015302Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Override resource limits",
      "source_hash": 16791509908017218995,
      "context_hash": 6989684378695889472,
      "translation": "리소스 제한 무시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015302Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Set hostname (UTS namespace)",
      "source_hash": 5041483929699159962,
      "context_hash": 14494890792782369573,
      "translation": "호스트 이름 설정(UTS 네임스페이스)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "namespace": "네임스페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015303Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "... and 40+ more",
      "source_hash": 2110284947245085687,
      "context_hash": 482615510514670701,
      "translation": "... 외 40개 이상",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015303Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Prefer more specific capabilities where possible.",
      "source_hash": 15269228790368773931,
      "context_hash": 4456669914548928579,
      "translation": "가능하면 더 구체적인 capability를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015304Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "If a library says \"requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN\", investigate whether a narrower capability works.",
      "source_hash": 1589415649857534935,
      "context_hash": 18033044046589204347,
      "translation": "라이브러리가 \"requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN\"이라고 한다면, 더 좁은 범위의 capability로도 동작하는지 조사하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:15:19.015304Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Further reading",
      "source_hash": 12384514314644059922,
      "context_hash": 4101621713231022004,
